From 84acf5a65897a0c8cece2d0bdb323fe73edd03a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Harness Workbench <codex-harness-workbench@localhost>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:53:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: enforce daemon config CAS and keep relay session
 continuity

Reject stale expectedRevision writes on the live config store, return
the authoritative snapshot on conflict, and keep desktop/dev-runner
relay reconnect paths aligned with revision-aware session responses.
